Z||000001||California Kid||11-29-2001||05:27 PM||||Think it would be a great idea.  There's a big parking lot at a doctors office bldg near 696 and Woodward (the owner of the bldg is a hot rod nut and told police to leave everybody alone that uses his lot). Cruisers get together there nearly every Friday and Saturday night.  It would be great to have a bunch of Fiero's show up!  Caution on any street racing on Woodward, the police are very sharp, ticket almost guaranteed!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/californiakidsig_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Nashco||11-29-2001||06:39 PM||||Granted we have a get together while I'm up at school, I'm always wanting to have a get together <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>From what few nights of cruising I've done around Detroit, it seems Gratiot is a much better road to cruise than Woodward.  Still, just seems like "cruising" around Detroit is a waste many times...you get about ten minutes worth of enjoyment in every hour...but maybe I just haven't been cruising with the right people in the right places! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
